    "title": "Stadium FX",
    "description": "The Stadium FX app is customized for large stadiums and sporting venues to provide a unique way for attendees to become a part of the atmosphere every super fan craves. From the fan-powered light shows, to coupons and special access to partner discounts, each activation is unique. Become a part of the fully immersive, spectacular experience, only available to those who join in-person when prompted. \r\n\r\nStadium FX synchronizes its interactive elements through the power of the stadium/in-venue sounds system.",
